  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your active deck focuses on large, powerful effects at the expense of variety.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cartomancy class feature, ability to place a greater portent into your active deck</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When building an active deck, you may choose to increase the number of greater portents in the deck by +1. If you do, the number of least portents and lesser portents allowed in that deck are each reduced by 2 and the first greater portent you play each day does not trigger on-play effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
